  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Young Women&apos;s Leadership with World Young Women&apos;s Christian Association (Indo-Pacific) 2020 - 2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment supports the Young Women&apos;s Christian Association (YWCA) to implement RiseUp! Phase IV.
RiseUp! Phase IV aims to support over 6,000 young women aged 18 to 30 years to build and exercise their leadership capabilities based on local contexts and priorities and build local capacity and sustainability in YWCA national Member Associations (MAs) professionalising aspects of the program rather than relying on women&#x2019;s volunteer labour. The RiseUp! approach enables young women to create safe spaces, build networks and advocate for change across the Indo-Pacific region. 
The program is implemented in nine countries across the Indo-Pacific region: Papua New Guinea, Solomon Islands, Myanmar, Thailand, Bangladesh, Sri Lanka, India, Samoa and Nepal.</narrative>
  </description>
